, color…"/></label><label className="field">Tienda<select value={item.platform} onChange={event => update(item.id, { platform: event.target.value as QuoteLine["platform"] })}><option>Temu</option><option>SHEIN</option></select></label></div><div className="field-row"><label className="field">Unidades *<input type="number" min="1" max="9999" step="1" value={item.quantity || ""} onChange={event => update(item.id, { quantity: Number(event.target.value) })} required/></label><label className="field">Precio unitario (RD$) *<input type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01" defaultValue={item.unitCents / 100} onChange={event => update(item.id, { unitCents: Math.round(Number(event.target.value) * 100) })} required/></label></div><div className="field-row"><label className="field">Cargos extra (RD$)<input type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01" defaultValue={item.extraCents / 100} onChange={event => update(item.id, { extraCents: Math.round(Number(event.target.value) * 100) })}/></label><label className="field">Descuento (RD$)<input type="number" min="0" max="1000000" step="0.01" defaultValue={item.discountCents / 100} onChange={event => update(item.id, { discountCents: Math.round(Number(event.target.value) * 100) })}/></label></div><p className="quote-subtotal">Subtotal: <strong>{money(lineTotal(item))}</strong></p></fieldset>)}</div><button type="button" className="button button-secondary" disabled={items.length >= 100 || busy} onClick={() => setItems(current => [...current, newLine()])}><Plus size={16}/> Agregar artículo</button><div className="form-total"><span>Total de la cotización</span><strong>{money(total)}</strong></div><label className="field">Notas<textarea name="notes" defaultValue={initial?.notes} rows={3} maxLength={2000} placeholder="Condiciones, entrega estimada…"/></label><p className="business-help">Aceptar una cotización no crea pedidos ni cobros automáticamente. Registra los artículos confirmados en Pedidos.</p>{error && <div className="inline-error" role="alert">{error}</div>}</div><div className="modal-footer"><button className="button button-plain" type="button" onClick={onClose} disabled={busy}>Cancelar</button><button className="button button-primary" disabled={busy || !clients.length}>{busy ? <LoaderCircle size={16} className="spin"/> : <Check size={16}/>} Guardar cotización</button></div></form></BusinessDialog>;
